         the theme tokens behind them, so a vibe button and a native
         button are the same object:
           Inter 13/20, label weight 600, 6px 12px, 32px tall, radius 8
           primary  #879CF7 → hover #6C7CC5 → active #515D94, white text
           navy     #001364 → hover #192A73 → active #334283
           neutral  #FFFFFF → hover #F2F2F2 → active #E5E5E5, navy text
